<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Reserve your spot · Antarctica</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/antarctica.css?v=checkout-20261022"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/antarctica-checkout.css?v=1"><script src="/static/js/antarctica-checkout.js?v=staff-4" defer></script></head>
<body class="antarctica expedition-checkout">
<div class="draft-banner">Checkout preview · No bookings, payments or subscriptions are submitted</div>
<header><a class="wordmark" href="?" aria-label="bitcoin++">bitcoin<span>++</span></a><span class="edition">COLD STORAGE EDITION / JAN 24–FEB 5, 2028</span><a href="?">Back to the expedition</a></header>
<main class="checkout-shell">
<nav aria-label="Checkout progress"><ol class="checkout-progress"><li aria-current="step">1 · Spots</li><li>2 · Berths</li><li>3 · Merch</li><li>4 · Payment</li></ol></nav>
<p class="checkout-preview-note">Preview availability: {{ .RemainingBerths }} public spots after {{ .StaffBerths }} staff holds. Total allocation: 25 berths across 9 twin cabins, 1 triple and 1 quad. Staff cabin assignments are pending; reservations remain closed.</p>
<form id="expedition-checkout" novalidate>
<section data-step="0" aria-labelledby="spots-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Your expedition starts here</p><h1 id="spots-heading" tabindex="-1">How many spots?</h1><p>Start with everyone in your group. You’ll arrange their berths next.</p><label for="party-size">Number of spots to reserve</label><input id="party-size" type="number" min="1" max="{{ .RemainingBerths }}" value="1" step="1" inputmode="numeric" required><p id="spots-remaining">{{ .RemainingBerths }} public spots remaining in this preview.</p></section>
<section data-step="1" hidden aria-labelledby="berths-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Make room for your group</p><h1 id="berths-heading" tabindex="-1">Choose your berths.</h1><p>Add a cabin arrangement for each part of your group. For example, three people can take two spots in one twin cabin and one spot in another.</p><p id="allocation-count" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="cabin-allocations"></div><button type="button" id="add-cabin" class="checkout-secondary">Add another cabin</button><p>For unfilled twin cabins, request an M, F or co-ed roommate arrangement. Triple and quad cabins default to co-ed. We’ll try to match your preference, but cannot guarantee it. Cabin numbers and deck locations are not guaranteed.</p><details class="ship-layout-reference"><summary>Explore the ship layout</summary><p>Reference only. This diagram includes cabins outside our allocation and does not show bookable cabin numbers.</p><a href="/static/img/antarctica/berths.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="/static/img/antarctica/berths.png" alt="Reference layout of decks 3 and 4, not available cabin inventory" width="929" height="509" loading="lazy"></a></details></section>
<section data-step="2" hidden aria-labelledby="merch-heading"><p class="eyebrow">A little extra for the journey</p><h1 id="merch-heading" tabindex="-1">Make it yours.</h1>{{ if .MerchSnapshot }}<p class="fine">Preview catalog: public-shop hat prices checked October 22, 2026. Quantities are illustrative, not live stock.</p>{{ end }}
{{ range .Merch }}<article class="checkout-merch">{{ if .Image }}<img src="{{ .Image }}" alt="{{ .Name }}" width="240" height="240">{{ end }}<div><h2>{{ .Name }}</h2>{{ if .Variant }}<p>{{ .Variant }}</p>{{ end }}<p>{{ .Price }} USD each</p><label for="merch-{{ .ID }}">Quantity</label><input type="number" id="merch-{{ .ID }}" class="merch-quantity" data-name="{{ .Name }}" data-variant="{{ .Variant }}" data-price="{{ .Cents }}" min="0" max="{{ .Max }}" step="1" value="0" inputmode="numeric"></div></article>{{ else }}<p>No hats are available from the catalog right now. You can continue without merch.</p>{{ end }}
<p id="merch-subtotal" aria-live="polite"></p><p class="fine">Merch is separate from your passage fare and is not eligible for the 5% passage discount. Hats are picked up onboard, with no shipping charge or shipping address required. Any applicable merchandise tax is still being determined.</p><p>Merch is optional. Continue without it whenever you’re ready.</p></section>
<section data-step="3" hidden aria-labelledby="payment-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Your passage south</p><h1 id="payment-heading" tabindex="-1">Review &amp; payment.</h1><div id="booking-summary"></div><fieldset><legend>Payment plan</legend><label class="checkout-check"><input type="radio" name="plan" value="installments" checked> Five installments of 20%</label><label class="checkout-check"><input type="radio" name="plan" value="full"> Pay in full at signup</label></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Payment method</legend><label class="checkout-check"><input type="radio" name="provider" value="stripe" checked> Card via Stripe</label><label class="checkout-check"><input type="radio" name="provider" value="opennode"> Bitcoin</label></fieldset><p>Save 5% on passage only when paying in full with bitcoin. Stripe and installment payments use the standard fare.</p><div id="checkout-totals" aria-live="polite"></div><label class="checkout-check newsletter-choice"><input type="checkbox" id="newsletter-opt-in"><span>Subscribe me to the <span class="wordmark brand-inline">bitcoin<span>++</span></span> newsletter.</span></label><p class="fine">Optional. Your choice does not affect your booking. In this preview, no subscription is created.</p><p>Final booking terms, traveler details and secure payment collection will be available before reservations open.</p><button type="button" class="button" disabled>Payments opening soon</button></section>
<p id="checkout-error" role="alert"></p><div class="checkout-actions"><button type="button" id="checkout-back" class="checkout-secondary" hidden>Back</button><button type="submit" id="checkout-next" class="button">Choose berths →</button></div>
</form><noscript><p>This checkout preview needs JavaScript. Reservations are not yet open.</p></noscript>
<div id="checkout-fares" hidden>{{ range .Berths }}<span data-berth="{{ .ID }}" data-price="{{ .PriceCents }}" data-name="{{ .Name }}"></span>{{ end }}</div>
</main></body></html>
